      "expected": " \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m\n \u001b[90m└─\u001b[0m \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m no such file \u001b[90m· total 0.010 s\u001b[0m"
    },
    {
      "name": "a warning box",
      "fn": "box",
      "color": false,
      "args": {
        "tone": "warn",
        "title": "Heads up",
        "text": "No GPU backend is active — running on CPU. Inference will be slow (the first request can take a minute or more)."
      },
      "expected": " ╭─ Heads up ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n │ No GPU backend is active — running on CPU. Inference will be slow (the   │\n │ first request can take a minute or more).                                │\n ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
    },
    {
      "name": "a tip box in color",
      "fn": "box",
      "color": true,
      "args": {
        "tone": "accent",
        "title": "Tip",
        "text": "A CUDA backend is available for this NVIDIA card."
      },
      "expected": " \u001b[36m╭─\u001b[0m \u001b[1mTip\u001b[0m \u001b[36m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\n \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m A CUDA backend is available for this NVIDIA card.                        \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\n \u001b[36m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m"
    },
    {
